PSM2 Connection Test Tool

Verifies PSM2 connectivity, data integrity, and tag-matching over the
OPA fabric.  Uses the same libpsm2/psm2perf infrastructure as the
existing latency and bandwidth benchmarks.

Tests:
  ping_pong       - round-trip message exchange (64 B, 100 iters)
  data_integrity  - send/recv with deterministic fill-pattern verification
  tag_match       - concurrent sends on different tags, verify isolation

Build:
  cd test_tool && make

Run:
  Server:   ./test_tool
  Client:   ./test_tool <server-hostname>
  All tests: ./test_tool <server-hostname> -a
  Custom size: ./test_tool <server-hostname> -s 65536 -a

Exit codes:
  0 = all tests passed
  1 = one or more failures
